1
00:00:17,440 --> 00:00:18,019
Don't move!

2
00:00:18,160 --> 00:00:19,300
Move and I'll kill you!

3
00:00:20,100 --> 00:00:20,500
What the...

4
00:00:21,100 --> 00:00:21,879
Come on. Get over here, come on.

5
00:00:21,920 --> 00:00:22,480
Come on!

6
00:00:23,879 --> 00:00:24,440
We're screwed.

7
00:00:25,559 --> 00:00:26,480
Snaggletooth is done for!

8
00:00:43,740 --> 00:00:44,359
Fall back!

9
00:00:44,420 --> 00:00:45,439
My ribs!

10
00:00:45,740 --> 00:00:46,320
Move, hurry!

11
00:00:46,979 --> 00:00:48,000
So damn annoying.

12
00:00:48,799 --> 00:00:49,359
Get lost!

13
00:00:54,759 --> 00:00:56,100
Bro, let's go, let's go.

14
00:00:57,920 --> 00:00:58,359
Bro.

15
00:00:58,719 --> 00:00:59,759
Who's that girl?

16
00:01:00,399 --> 00:01:01,200
She's pretty tough.

17
00:01:01,399 --> 00:01:02,460
Tell me about it.

18
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:03,880
Got a nasty temper.

19
00:01:05,599 --> 00:01:05,980
Hurry up.

20
00:01:11,079 --> 00:01:11,739
She's...

21
00:01:17,180 --> 00:01:17,739
What time is it?

22
00:01:19,719 --> 00:01:20,480
You held me up.

23
00:01:20,579 --> 00:01:21,340
I'm really running late now.

24
00:01:21,879 --> 00:01:22,540
Where's my bike?

25
00:01:24,480 --> 00:01:25,640
I'll wait for you here tonight.

26
00:01:25,739 --> 00:01:26,359
I'm taking off.

27
00:01:26,599 --> 00:01:27,459
Good food, good booze.

28
00:01:27,879 --> 00:01:28,780
Let's catch up!

29
00:01:29,480 --> 00:01:30,879
All right, all right, we'll talk tonight.

30
00:01:34,280 --> 00:01:35,060
Brother Ziwen.

31
00:01:35,540 --> 00:01:36,359
Who's that guy?

32
00:01:38,219 --> 00:01:38,939
Take a look at him.

33
00:01:39,599 --> 00:01:40,560
Does he look familiar?

34
00:01:47,659 --> 00:01:49,019
Asking his name, startled at first sight,

35
00:01:49,739 --> 00:01:50,840
hearing it, recalling an old face.

36
00:01:52,439 --> 00:01:52,859
He

37
00:01:54,019 --> 00:01:55,060
is Liu Haizhu.

38
00:02:23,539 --> 00:02:24,080
Mengmeng,

39
00:02:24,500 --> 00:02:26,039
why didn't Haizhu show up today?

40
00:02:30,400 --> 00:02:31,139
You know how men are.

41
00:02:31,180 --> 00:02:32,300
You can't give them an inch.

42
00:02:33,020 --> 00:02:34,259
Give him a little smile,

43
00:02:34,340 --> 00:02:35,419
and he thinks he's king of the world.

44
00:02:36,699 --> 00:02:37,620
If you ask me,

45
00:02:38,120 --> 00:02:39,300
leaving you hanging like this

46
00:02:39,400 --> 00:02:40,240
means he just doesn't care about you.

47
00:02:43,319 --> 00:02:43,939
Mengmeng,

48
00:02:44,520 --> 00:02:46,219
didn't Zhuzi say he went to get coal?

49
00:02:46,560 --> 00:02:47,819
Maybe coal is hard to come by.

50
00:02:48,719 --> 00:02:50,479
Ask him what happened when you see him tomorrow.

51
00:02:50,900 --> 00:02:51,639
No need to get upset.

52
00:02:56,080 --> 00:02:56,580
Sis,

53
00:02:56,900 --> 00:02:58,599
take a look and tell me if this outfit works.

54
00:02:59,900 --> 00:03:00,340
Yeah.

55
00:03:00,379 --> 00:03:00,939
This one?

56
00:03:01,000 --> 00:03:01,580
Looks great!

57
00:03:02,259 --> 00:03:03,740
Once my Xiuer dresses up,

58
00:03:03,819 --> 00:03:04,919
she looks mighty fine.

59
00:03:07,180 --> 00:03:07,659
Mengmeng,

60
00:03:08,099 --> 00:03:09,219
why haven't you changed yet?

61
00:03:10,060 --> 00:03:10,960
Didn't I tell you?

62
00:03:11,020 --> 00:03:12,180
I'm not interested in dance halls.

63
00:03:14,379 --> 00:03:15,379
I'm not into being trendy.

64
00:03:16,319 --> 00:03:16,960
By the way, Xiuer.

65
00:03:17,479 --> 00:03:18,939
My man, Brother Biao,

66
00:03:19,080 --> 00:03:20,599
rolls with a big crowd and has serious pull.

67
00:03:21,039 --> 00:03:22,439
Those younger buddies of his,

68
00:03:22,680 --> 00:03:23,840
every single one's sharp-looking.

69
00:03:24,039 --> 00:03:25,580
Way better than those blockheads

70
00:03:25,780 --> 00:03:27,379
and troublemakers.

71
00:03:28,060 --> 00:03:30,199
It's all about the market economy these days.

72
00:03:33,139 --> 00:03:34,500
Let me take you out to see for yourself.

73
00:03:34,680 --> 00:03:36,259
They're raking in cash hand over fist.

74
00:03:36,400 --> 00:03:36,780
Let's go.

75
00:03:37,120 --> 00:03:38,379
I have my own two hands.

76
00:03:38,740 --> 00:03:39,879
Why should I depend on a man?

77
00:03:41,439 --> 00:03:42,360
Doesn't know what's good for her.

78
00:03:42,400 --> 00:03:42,780
Come on.

79
00:03:42,960 --> 00:03:43,580
Let's go, let's go.

80
00:03:43,759 --> 00:03:44,800
We're heading out, Mengmeng.

81
00:03:45,000 --> 00:03:45,780
Let's go, let's go.

82
00:04:10,780 --> 00:04:11,379
Zhou Meng!

83
00:04:13,240 --> 00:04:13,800
Zhou Meng!

84
00:04:26,120 --> 00:04:26,620
Zhou Meng

85
00:04:39,199 --> 00:04:39,660
Zhuzi!

86
00:04:40,019 --> 00:04:40,839
Here to see Zhou Meng?

87
00:04:41,899 --> 00:04:42,620
No.

88
00:04:43,040 --> 00:04:44,019
Just out for a stroll.

89
00:04:44,579 --> 00:04:46,420
Strolling to the women's dorm at night?

90
00:04:47,259 --> 00:04:47,779
No...

91
00:04:47,899 --> 00:04:48,759
I, well...

92
00:04:50,139 --> 00:04:50,819
Fine, fine.

93
00:04:51,160 --> 00:04:52,040
Enjoy your stroll.

94
00:04:53,819 --> 00:04:54,860
Uh, Zhou Meng...

95
00:04:55,560 --> 00:04:56,259
Today, I...

96
00:04:57,620 --> 00:04:58,279
I'm sorry.

97
00:04:58,720 --> 00:04:59,620
Tomorrow when you're free,

98
00:04:59,740 --> 00:05:00,980
I'll explain everything.

99
00:05:01,779 --> 00:05:02,680
Get some rest early.

100
00:05:04,959 --> 00:05:05,879
After such a hectic day,

101
00:05:06,240 --> 00:05:07,740
I ended up standing Zhou Meng up.

102
00:05:08,079 --> 00:05:09,839
Yet that old friend from five years ago...

103
00:05:10,060 --> 00:05:10,860
Feng Ziwen...

104
00:05:11,259 --> 00:05:11,720
I wondered

105
00:05:11,759 --> 00:05:13,660
how he ended up like this.

106
00:05:13,959 --> 00:05:15,379
I wanted to grab a drink with him,

107
00:05:15,519 --> 00:05:17,459
just the two of us catching up.

108
00:05:17,720 --> 00:05:18,180
Come on.

109
00:05:21,139 --> 00:05:21,860
Come on in.

110
00:05:22,100 --> 00:05:23,120
Quiet down, everyone.

111
00:05:23,480 --> 00:05:24,279
Our guest has arrived.

112
00:05:28,639 --> 00:05:30,360
Listen up, let me introduce him.

113
00:05:30,819 --> 00:05:31,800
Liu Haizhu.

114
00:05:31,939 --> 00:05:32,680
Zhuzi.

115
00:05:32,920 --> 00:05:34,220
He's my brother through thick and thin.

116
00:05:34,699 --> 00:05:35,639
From this day on,

117
00:05:35,980 --> 00:05:37,040
he's your brother too.

118
00:05:37,160 --> 00:05:38,000
Call him Brother Zhuzi!

119
00:05:38,160 --> 00:05:39,220
Brother Zhuzi!

120
00:05:40,180 --> 00:05:41,079
This whole feast

121
00:05:41,339 --> 00:05:42,600
was made for Brother Zhuzi!

122
00:05:43,180 --> 00:05:44,139
Let's drink up!

123
00:05:44,439 --> 00:05:45,339
Yeah!

124
00:05:46,339 --> 00:05:47,079
Come, sit.

125
00:05:47,240 --> 00:05:47,639
Alright.

126
00:05:49,240 --> 00:05:49,660
Wait.

127
00:05:50,339 --> 00:05:50,879
Wait, a-all this...

128
00:05:51,060 --> 00:05:52,040
These are all your brothers?

129
00:05:52,339 --> 00:05:54,259
They're our brothers now.

130
00:05:55,939 --> 00:05:56,360
So?

131
00:05:56,379 --> 00:05:59,019
Not bad for street vendors, huh?

132
00:06:00,779 --> 00:06:01,279
Come on.

133
00:06:01,560 --> 00:06:02,379
Let me toast you first.

134
00:06:03,100 --> 00:06:04,360
You guys are too kind.

135
00:06:04,399 --> 00:06:05,199
Come on, now.

136
00:06:06,259 --> 00:06:06,980
Come on.

137
00:06:13,839 --> 00:06:14,480
Brother Zhuzi.

138
00:06:14,860 --> 00:06:16,100
I have to raise a glass to you.

139
00:06:16,579 --> 00:06:18,000
If you hadn't saved me five years ago,

140
00:06:18,420 --> 00:06:19,279
I, Chen Baige,

141
00:06:19,319 --> 00:06:20,399
wouldn't be standing here today.

142
00:06:22,040 --> 00:06:22,740
S-Sister...

143
00:06:23,399 --> 00:06:25,019
Don't mention it.

144
00:06:25,420 --> 00:06:26,180
As for me,

145
00:06:26,620 --> 00:06:27,740
I just happened to be there.

146
00:06:28,199 --> 00:06:29,000
Besides, I mean,

147
00:06:29,040 --> 00:06:30,300
if you walk away when trouble hits,

148
00:06:30,420 --> 00:06:31,800
are you even a real man?

149
00:06:32,459 --> 00:06:33,040
See that?

150
00:06:33,139 --> 00:06:34,319
He-He remembers everything, right?

151
00:06:34,399 --> 00:06:35,240
Come on, come on.

152
00:06:42,860 --> 00:06:43,939
Come on, don't just stand there.

153
00:06:43,959 --> 00:06:44,720
Let's all sit down.

154
00:06:47,500 --> 00:06:48,399
So Zhuzi,

155
00:06:48,720 --> 00:06:49,560
it's my turn now, right?

156
00:06:51,220 --> 00:06:51,819
Wait a second.

157
00:06:52,519 --> 00:06:53,139
Um...

158
00:06:53,759 --> 00:06:55,560
What happened to that scoundrel?

159
00:06:55,740 --> 00:06:56,560
How many years did he get?

160
00:06:58,180 --> 00:06:59,279
You mean that old thug?

161
00:06:59,420 --> 00:07:00,019
Old He.

162
00:07:00,660 --> 00:07:02,459
He took off right after it happened.

163
00:07:03,100 --> 00:07:04,560
Five years, and nobody's found him.

164
00:07:15,120 --> 00:07:17,060
There are only two things on my mind.

165
00:07:17,500 --> 00:07:18,000
First,

166
00:07:18,680 --> 00:07:19,560
even if I have to search every inch of the earth,

167
00:07:20,279 --> 00:07:21,500
I'm going to hunt him down.

168
00:07:22,139 --> 00:07:22,540
Second,

169
00:07:23,680 --> 00:07:24,579
the waters of Songliao

170
00:07:24,779 --> 00:07:25,639
have been muddy for too long.

171
00:07:26,259 --> 00:07:27,579
It's time to clean them up.

172
00:07:28,300 --> 00:07:29,120
Except the rules...

173
00:07:29,660 --> 00:07:30,360
I make them.

174
00:07:33,959 --> 00:07:34,860
Come on, brothers!

175
00:07:36,980 --> 00:07:38,959
Today we drink deep to celebrate!

176
00:07:39,220 --> 00:07:41,319
We won't rest till our ambition is met!

177
00:07:41,939 --> 00:07:44,279
Ahead lies time to show our mettle,

178
00:07:44,399 --> 00:07:47,379
shedding hot blood to write our tale!

179
00:07:47,620 --> 00:07:48,160
Come on!

180
00:07:48,699 --> 00:07:50,060
Bottoms up! Drink!

181
00:07:55,060 --> 00:07:56,279
Why's everyone calling me Brother Zhuzi?

182
00:07:56,319 --> 00:07:57,300
Just call me Zhuzi.

183
00:07:57,660 --> 00:07:58,620
We're all brothers here.

184
00:07:58,720 --> 00:08:00,060
Right, good buddy Zhuzi!

185
00:08:00,199 --> 00:08:01,319
Zhuzi, come here, come on.

186
00:08:01,680 --> 00:08:03,720
When you came to buy coal from us today,

187
00:08:04,100 --> 00:08:04,759
well, you see...

188
00:08:04,860 --> 00:08:05,860
my boy had an attitude.

189
00:08:05,939 --> 00:08:06,639
I'm here to apologize.

190
00:08:06,680 --> 00:08:07,220
It's no big deal.

191
00:08:07,259 --> 00:08:08,439
Just come to me if you ever need anything!

192
00:08:08,480 --> 00:08:09,040
You got it, bro.

193
00:08:09,959 --> 00:08:11,279
Zhuzi is a really honest guy.

194
00:08:11,540 --> 00:08:12,639
Zhuzi is having a great time drinking.

195
00:08:12,680 --> 00:08:13,100
Isn't he?

196
00:08:13,480 --> 00:08:13,939
Got any booze left over there?

197
00:08:14,019 --> 00:08:14,879
Pour me some.

198
00:08:14,959 --> 00:08:15,519
Zhuzi!

199
00:08:15,680 --> 00:08:16,319
Daguang!

200
00:08:16,379 --> 00:08:17,139
Get some liquor.

201
00:08:17,860 --> 00:08:18,720
We're out of liquor.

202
00:08:19,199 --> 00:08:19,579
All gone.

203
00:08:20,259 --> 00:08:21,360
Hold on, I'll go get some.

204
00:08:21,819 --> 00:08:22,639
Let's not take this one.

205
00:08:22,699 --> 00:08:24,160
It's over ten yuan a bottle, way too pricey.

206
00:08:25,300 --> 00:08:25,860
What are you doing?

207
00:08:25,899 --> 00:08:26,560
What are you talking about?

208
00:08:27,980 --> 00:08:28,939
I owe him my life!

209
00:08:29,259 --> 00:08:30,600
Even opening the finest nectar is worth it!

210
00:08:30,620 --> 00:08:31,180
All right, all right.

211
00:08:31,220 --> 00:08:31,680
Go open the bottle.

212
00:08:32,340 --> 00:08:33,139
Go easy on the drink.

213
00:08:33,919 --> 00:08:35,019
Bottoms up, bro!

214
00:08:36,620 --> 00:08:37,779
I'll drink with you again in a bit!

215
00:08:38,700 --> 00:08:39,139
Hold on a second!

216
00:08:42,720 --> 00:08:44,639
I want everyone in Songliao to know

217
00:08:44,679 --> 00:08:45,799
that I, Eastern Tyrant,

218
00:08:46,200 --> 00:08:48,539
have a brother for life named Liu Haizhu!

219
00:08:51,179 --> 00:08:51,779
Pour some! Come on.

220
00:08:52,059 --> 00:08:52,679
You don't believe me?

221
00:08:54,460 --> 00:08:55,519
Everyone, hold up a second!

222
00:08:56,820 --> 00:08:57,700
This drink...

223
00:08:58,059 --> 00:08:59,039
is to Brother Zhuzi!

224
00:08:59,220 --> 00:08:59,679
To Zhuzi!

225
00:08:59,700 --> 00:09:00,980
To Zhuzi running the turf!

226
00:09:01,220 --> 00:09:01,700
Come on!

227
00:09:02,500 --> 00:09:03,139
Cheers!

228
00:09:03,320 --> 00:09:04,500
Bottoms up! Drink!

229
00:09:07,700 --> 00:09:08,899
Not bad, Zhuzi!

230
00:09:09,120 --> 00:09:11,700
People aren't kidding—Zhuzi is one fierce fighter!

231
00:09:11,820 --> 00:09:13,100
Tell me, with a guy like him,

232
00:09:13,200 --> 00:09:15,200
who could handle him except my bro?

233
00:09:15,720 --> 00:09:17,200
He can handle me?

234
00:09:19,340 --> 00:09:20,179
Let's test it out!

235
00:09:21,419 --> 00:09:22,960
Let's spar while the booze is kicking in!

236
00:09:23,059 --> 00:09:23,779
No way, forget it.

237
00:09:24,879 --> 00:09:26,620
Bring it on! Like I'm scared of you?

238
00:09:26,700 --> 00:09:27,259
Let's go!

239
00:09:29,500 --> 00:09:31,059
Come on! Get him! Get him!

240
00:09:31,320 --> 00:09:32,759
Go, go, go!

241
00:09:32,840 --> 00:09:33,820
Come on! Let's go!

242
00:09:35,299 --> 00:09:35,759
Ram him!

243
00:09:36,399 --> 00:09:37,919
Take him down! Take him down!

244
00:09:39,679 --> 00:09:40,200
Get him!

245
00:09:44,820 --> 00:09:45,820
Nice! Good!

246
00:09:45,879 --> 00:09:46,460
Push harder!

247
00:09:48,340 --> 00:09:49,000
Put your back into it!

248
00:10:14,460 --> 00:10:15,419
Get up!

249
00:10:17,440 --> 00:10:18,220
Make him yield!

250
00:10:19,059 --> 00:10:19,919
Get him! Get him!

251
00:10:21,019 --> 00:10:22,080
Come on, let's fight!

252
00:10:23,299 --> 00:10:23,840
Get him!

253
00:10:35,720 --> 00:10:36,220
Nice!

254
00:10:36,480 --> 00:10:37,419
Brother Ziwen!

255
00:10:38,080 --> 00:10:39,220
Brother Ziwen's a real man!

256
00:10:40,259 --> 00:10:41,639
Get up! Get up!

257
00:10:41,960 --> 00:10:43,360
Stand tall!

258
00:10:44,360 --> 00:10:45,940
Brother Zhuzi, don't back down!

259
00:10:46,000 --> 00:10:47,019
Stand tall!

260
00:10:47,240 --> 00:10:47,840
Stand tall!

261
00:10:47,879 --> 00:10:48,460
Zhuzi.

262
00:10:48,820 --> 00:10:50,480
You can't just fight with brute force.

263
00:10:50,820 --> 00:10:52,139
Watch which foot loses balance,

264
00:10:52,340 --> 00:10:53,580
and which shoulder drops.

265
00:10:53,820 --> 00:10:55,159
Fighting isn't just messing around.

266
00:10:55,440 --> 00:10:56,620
You have to pay close attention to the details.

267
00:10:58,019 --> 00:10:58,960
All right, again!

268
00:10:59,000 --> 00:10:59,600
Again!

269
00:11:04,460 --> 00:11:04,980
Again!

270
00:11:16,419 --> 00:11:17,220
Good, good.

271
00:11:26,679 --> 00:11:27,259
Come on, again.

272
00:11:27,639 --> 00:11:28,279
Bring it on!

273
00:11:30,519 --> 00:11:31,220
That's enough.

274
00:11:31,440 --> 00:11:33,320
Two real men, and you never know when to stop fooling around.

275
00:11:35,200 --> 00:11:36,059
You've got skills.

276
00:11:37,840 --> 00:11:38,620
All right, that's it.

277
00:11:38,659 --> 00:11:39,419
Break it up, everyone.

278
00:11:40,039 --> 00:11:41,139
Brother Zhuzi, let's get a drink.

279
00:11:41,179 --> 00:11:41,799
Drink up, drink up!

280
00:11:41,980 --> 00:11:42,740
Seeing double, bro.

281
00:11:42,820 --> 00:11:43,440
Daguang.

282
00:11:43,720 --> 00:11:44,179
Bro.

283
00:11:47,879 --> 00:11:48,580
Sit, sit down.

284
00:11:53,399 --> 00:11:54,159
Thanks, brother.

285
00:11:55,019 --> 00:11:55,639
Feng...

286
00:11:56,720 --> 00:11:57,700
Feng Ziwen.

287
00:11:58,580 --> 00:11:59,340
I've noticed something.

288
00:12:00,320 --> 00:12:01,740
You're quite an interesting guy.

289
00:12:03,220 --> 00:12:04,080
Which of us is older?

290
00:12:04,179 --> 00:12:05,639
If I'm older, you can be my little bro.

291
00:12:06,019 --> 00:12:06,700
Listen to you...

292
00:12:07,860 --> 00:12:08,620
What the hell?

293
00:12:09,200 --> 00:12:10,320
Are you out of your mind?

294
00:12:10,440 --> 00:12:12,039
Zhuzi's a down-to-earth guy.

295
00:12:12,440 --> 00:12:14,899
I, Eastern Tyrant, like honest brothers best.

296
00:12:16,639 --> 00:12:17,320
Follow me from now on.

297
00:12:18,659 --> 00:12:19,399
Us brothers together,

298
00:12:20,340 --> 00:12:21,320
we'll carve out our own empire.

299
00:12:21,460 --> 00:12:22,940
Yeah, roll with us!

300
00:12:23,179 --> 00:12:24,320
Follow Eastern Tyrant,

301
00:12:24,419 --> 00:12:26,600
and you'll have meat, booze, and total respect.

302
00:12:26,779 --> 00:12:27,879
Just look at me.

303
00:12:28,360 --> 00:12:29,919
Wherever I go now,

304
00:12:30,159 --> 00:12:32,279
who doesn't call me Brother Daguang?

305
00:12:38,320 --> 00:12:38,980
Me?

306
00:12:39,740 --> 00:12:40,639
Liu Haizhu.

307
00:12:41,799 --> 00:12:44,200
A legit state factory worker.

308
00:12:44,620 --> 00:12:46,139
I've got an iron rice bowl.

309
00:12:47,100 --> 00:12:48,039
And what about you guys?

310
00:12:48,779 --> 00:12:51,360
Aren't you all just street loafers?

311
00:12:51,379 --> 00:12:53,100
What's wrong with being street loafers?

312
00:12:53,700 --> 00:12:54,740
We don't have to kiss anyone's ass,

313
00:12:54,879 --> 00:12:56,120
or suck up to superiors.

314
00:12:56,279 --> 00:12:57,220
Just us brothers together,

315
00:12:57,360 --> 00:12:57,759
living happily,

316
00:12:57,879 --> 00:12:58,960
free and wild. Isn't that great?

317
00:13:00,080 --> 00:13:01,980
No, I've got brothers at the factory too!

318
00:13:02,159 --> 00:13:03,460
What am I missing?

319
00:13:04,320 --> 00:13:05,320
Do you have any idea

320
00:13:06,179 --> 00:13:07,600
what kind of perks I get?

321
00:13:07,919 --> 00:13:08,460
Tell me.

322
00:13:09,379 --> 00:13:10,559
Every year,

323
00:13:11,759 --> 00:13:12,539
when autumn comes,

324
00:13:13,159 --> 00:13:17,000
our factory hands out two crates of Guoguang apples.

325
00:13:17,320 --> 00:13:17,960
Apples!

326
00:13:18,139 --> 00:13:20,039
Coal rations for winter,

327
00:13:20,679 --> 00:13:23,580
and even beltfish for the New Year!

328
00:13:24,860 --> 00:13:26,039
You roll with him,

329
00:13:26,200 --> 00:13:27,399
do you get beltfish for the New Year?

330
00:13:27,480 --> 00:13:28,299
Any beltfish?

331
00:13:36,360 --> 00:13:36,919
Didn't think so.

332
00:13:36,940 --> 00:13:38,799
He really is a piece of work.

333
00:13:40,539 --> 00:13:41,779
All right, Zhuzi.

334
00:13:42,419 --> 00:13:43,720
You've got your way of living.

335
00:13:44,700 --> 00:13:45,379
This drink...

336
00:13:47,080 --> 00:13:48,879
is to your apples and beltfish.

337
00:13:51,279 --> 00:13:52,179
But mark my words:

338
00:13:53,039 --> 00:13:54,340
here with Feng Ziwen,

339
00:13:54,519 --> 00:13:56,419
there'll always be a seat saved for you.

340
00:14:10,000 --> 00:14:10,539
Feng Ziwen.

341
00:14:11,539 --> 00:14:12,460
When we get the chance,

342
00:14:13,759 --> 00:14:15,100
I'll take you to hang out at our factory.

343
00:14:16,320 --> 00:14:17,419
I'll also let you meet

344
00:14:18,259 --> 00:14:19,340
my brothers.

345
00:14:22,679 --> 00:14:23,639
They're a fun bunch, too.
